    <div class="terms-block">
      <h2 class="terms-heading">Who is responsible</h2>
      <p class="body-text">Isabel Brouwer, trading under the name <strong>DNIB</strong> (Chamber of Commerce 82561125), based in Soest, the Netherlands, is responsible for the processing of personal data via this website (isabelbrouwer.nl). Questions about this policy are welcome at <a href="mailto:contact@isabelbrouwer.nl">contact@isabelbrouwer.nl</a>.</p>
