    <div class="terms-block">
      <h2 class="terms-heading">What data I collect</h2>
      <p class="body-text">Via this website I collect only anonymised visitor statistics through Google Analytics. I do not collect names, email addresses or other personal data through the website itself. When you contact me by email or telephone, I retain your details solely to enable our communication.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-block">
      <h2 class="terms-heading">Google Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p class="body-text">This website uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to gain insight into how visitors use the website. The following measures are taken to protect your privacy:</p>
      <ul class="terms-list">
        <li>IP addresses are anonymised before being stored.</li>
        <li>No advertising features or personalised tracking are enabled.</li>
        <li>Data is retained in accordance with the standard Google Analytics retention period (14 months).</li>
        <li>No data is shared with other Google services for advertising purposes.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin-top:0.75rem">Google Analytics places cookies on your device. Cookies are small text files stored by your browser. You can always refuse or delete cookies through your browser settings.</p>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin-top:0.75rem">More information about how Google handles data can be found in the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-block">
      <h2 class="terms-heading">Your rights</h2>
      <p class="body-text">Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) you have the following rights:</p>
      <ul class="terms-list">
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request what data I hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> You can have incorrect data corrected.</li>
        <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> You can request that your data be deleted.</li>
        <li><strong>Objection:</strong> You can object to the processing of your data.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin-top:0.75rem">Send a message to <a href="mailto:contact@isabelbrouwer.nl">contact@isabelbrouwer.nl</a> to exercise these rights. I will respond within 30 days.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-block">
      <h2 class="terms-heading">External links</h2>
